<html ><head ><meta charset="UTF-8"  /><meta name="author" content="Martin Walther - @tinuwalther"  /><meta name="keywords" content="Pode, PSHTML, PowerShell, Mermaid Diagram"  /><meta name="description" content="Builds beatuifull HTML-Files with PSHTML from native PowerShell-Scripts"  /><link rel="stylesheet" href="\assets\BootStrap\bootstrap.min.css"  /><link rel="stylesheet" href="\assets\style\style.css"  /><script src="\assets\BootStrap\bootstrap.bundle.min.js"  ></script><script src="\assets\Chartjs\Chart.bundle.min.js"  ></script><title >#PSXi Pester Result</title><link href="/assets/img/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/x-icon"  /></head><Body ><header ><div Class="jumbotron text-center" Id="j1" Style="padding:15; background-color:#012456"  ><p ><h1 >#PSXi Pester Result</h1></p><p >I ♥ PS Pode > This is an example for using pode and PSHTML, requested by API. The page is 
$(if(Test-Path 'D:\github.com\PodePSHTML\views\Pester-Result.pode'){
    $($regex = '[0-9]{4}\-[0-9]{2}\-[0-9]{2}\s[0-9]{2}\:[0-9]{2}\:[0-9]{2}')
    $($index = Get-Content 'D:\github.com\PodePSHTML\views\Pester-Result.pode')
    $($created = Get-Date ([regex]::Match($index, $regex).Value))
    $($diffTime = New-TimeSpan -Start $created -End (Get-Date))
    $(if($diffTime.TotalMinutes -gt 60 -and $diffTime.TotalMinutes -lt 1440){
        # $badge = 'badge badge-warning' # Bootstrap v4.6.x
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-warning' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    }elseif($diffTime.TotalMinutes -gt 1440){
        # $badge = 'badge badge-danger' # Bootstrap v4.6.x
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-danger' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    }else{
        # $badge = 'badge badge-success' # Bootstrap v4.6.x 
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-success' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    })
    $(span -class $badge {'{0} Days {1} Hours {2} Minutes' -f $diffTime.Days, $diffTime.Hours, $diffTime.Minutes})
})
 old.</p></div></header><Section Id="section"  ><nav Class="navbar navbar-expand-sm bg-dark navbar-dark sticky-top"  ><div Class="container-fluid"  ><a Class="navbar-brand" href="/" Target="_self"  >»HOME</a><button Class="navbar-toggler" data-bs-target="#collapsibleNavbar" data-bs-toggle="collapse" type="button"  ><span Class="navbar-toggler-icon"  ></span></button><div Class="collapse navbar-collapse" Id="collapsibleNavbar"  ><ul Class="navbar-nav"  ><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" href="https://pester.dev/" Target="_blank"  >Pester</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" href="#PassedTests" Target="_self"  >Passed</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" href="#FailedTests" Target="_self"  >Failed</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" href="#NotRunTests" Target="_self"  >NotRun</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" href="#SkippedTests" Target="_self"  >Skipped</a></li><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Class="nav-link" href="/help" Target="_self"  >Help</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><div Class="Container" Id="Content"  ><h1 Style="color:#212529"  >Result of some Pester Tests</h1><p Style="color:#000"  >Based on input admin.ch, sbb.ch</p><div Class="row align-items-center"  ><div Class="col-md"  ><p ></p></div><div Class="col-md"  ><canvas Width="800px" Height="300px" Id="BarCanvas"  >Canvas not supported in your browser</canvas></div><div Class="col-md"  ><p ></p></div></div></div><script >var ctx = document.getElementById("BarCanvas").getContext('2d'); var myChart = new Chart(ctx, {"type":"bar","data":{"labels":[""],"datasets":[{"xAxisID":null,"yAxisID":null,"backgroundColor":"green","borderColor":"","borderWidth":1,"borderSkipped":null,"hoverBackgroundColor":"green","hoverBorderColor":"white","hoverBorderWidth":0,"data":[6],"label":["Passed"]},{"xAxisID":null,"yAxisID":null,"backgroundColor":"red","borderColor":"","borderWidth":1,"borderSkipped":null,"hoverBackgroundColor":"red","hoverBorderColor":"white","hoverBorderWidth":0,"data":[2],"label":["Failed"]},{"xAxisID":null,"yAxisID":null,"backgroundColor":"yellow","borderColor":"","borderWidth":1,"borderSkipped":null,"hoverBackgroundColor":"yellow","hoverBorderColor":"white","hoverBorderWidth":0,"data":[2],"label":["NotRun"]},{"xAxisID":null,"yAxisID":null,"backgroundColor":"blue","borderColor":"","borderWidth":1,"borderSkipped":null,"hoverBackgroundColor":"blue","hoverBorderColor":"white","hoverBorderWidth":0,"data":[2],"label":["Skipped"]}]},"options":{"barPercentage":1,"categoryPercentage":1,"responsive":false,"barThickness":null,"maxBarThickness":0,"offsetGridLines":true,"scales":{"yAxes":[{"ticks":{"beginAtZero":true}}],"xAxes":[""]},"title":{"display":false,"text":null},"animation":{"onComplete":null}}} );</script><div Class="Container" Id="Content"  ><article Id="pester"  ><p Class="accordion" Id="accordionPesterTests"  ><h2 Id="PassedTests" Style="color:#212529"  >Passed</h2><div Class="accordion-item"  ><h2 Class="accordion-header"  ><button Class="accordion-button collapsed" aria-expanded="false" data-bs-target="#collapsePassed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-controls="collapsePassed" type="button"  ><p Style="color:#000"  >Great - This are the Tests that passed. Click to show/hide the Tests...</p></button></h2></div><div Class="accordion-collapse collapse collapse" Id="collapsePassed" data-bs-parent="#accordionPesterTests"  ><div Class="card card-body"  ><Table Class="table table-responsive table-striped table-hover"  ><thead Class="thead-dark"  ><tr ><th >Block</th><th >TestName</th><th >Result</th><th >Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody ><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetDig to sbb.ch should return true</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0031038</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetDig to admin.ch should return true</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0211412</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetDig to sbb.ch should return a PSCustomObject</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0059243</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetDig to admin.ch should return a PSCustomObject</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0029712</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetTping to sbb.ch should return true</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0352761</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetTping to admin.ch should return true</td><td >Passed</td><td >00:00:00.0304737</td></tr></tbody></Table></div></div><h2 Id="FailedTests" Style="color:#212529"  >Failed</h2><div Class="accordion-item"  ><h2 Class="accordion-header"  ><button Class="accordion-button collapsed" aria-expanded="false" data-bs-target="#collapseFailed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-controls="collapseFailed" type="button"  ><p Style="color:#000"  >Ompf - This are the Tests that failed. Click to show/hide the Tests...</p></button></h2></div><div Class="accordion-collapse collapse show" Id="collapseFailed" data-bs-parent="#accordionPesterTests"  ><div Class="card card-body"  ><Table Class="table table-responsive table-striped table-hover table-danger"  ><thead Class="thead-dark"  ><tr ><th >Block</th><th >TestName</th><th >Result</th><th >Duration</th><th >Message</th></tr></thead><tbody ><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetWping to sbb.ch should return true</td><td >Failed</td><td >00:00:00.1787392</td><td >Expected $true, but got $false.</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetWping to admin.ch should return true</td><td >Failed</td><td >00:00:00.0805350</td><td >Expected $true, but got $false.</td></tr></tbody></Table></div></div><h2 Id="NotRunTests" Style="color:#212529"  >NotRun</h2><div Class="accordion-item"  ><h2 Class="accordion-header"  ><button Class="accordion-button collapsed" aria-expanded="false" data-bs-target="#collapseNotRun" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-controls="collapseNotRun" type="button"  ><p Style="color:#000"  >Nevermind - Excluded Tests by Tag name. Click to show/hide the Tests...</p></button></h2></div><div Class="accordion-collapse collapse collapse" Id="collapseNotRun" data-bs-parent="#accordionPesterTests"  ><div Class="card card-body"  ><Table Class="table table-responsive table-striped table-hover"  ><thead Class="thead-dark"  ><tr ><th >Block</th><th >TestName</th><th >Result</th><th >Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody ><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetPing to <_> should return true</td><td >NotRun</td><td >00:00:00.0000693</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetPing to <_> should return true</td><td >NotRun</td><td >00:00:00.0000511</td></tr></tbody></Table></div></div><h2 Id="SkippedTests" Style="color:#212529"  >Skipped</h2><div Class="accordion-item"  ><h2 Class="accordion-header"  ><button Class="accordion-button collapsed" aria-expanded="false" data-bs-target="#collapseSkipped" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-controls="collapseSkipped" type="button"  ><p Style="color:#000"  >Nevermind - Excluded Tests by the skip-parameter. Click to show/hide the Tests...</p></button></h2></div><div Class="accordion-collapse collapse collapse" Id="collapseSkipped" data-bs-parent="#accordionPesterTests"  ><div Class="card card-body"  ><Table Class="table table-responsive table-striped table-hover"  ><thead Class="thead-dark"  ><tr ><th >Block</th><th >TestName</th><th >Result</th><th >Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody ><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetUping to <_> should return true</td><td >Skipped</td><td >00:00:00.0006442</td></tr><tr ><td >[-] Test PsNetTools</td><td >Test-PsNetUping to <_> should return true</td><td >Skipped</td><td >00:00:00.0005763</td></tr></tbody></Table></div></div></p></article></div></Section><pre Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the page: I ♥ PS > Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/pester -Method Post -Body '["sbb.ch","admin.ch"]'</pre></Body><div Class="container-fluid" Style="background-color:#343a40"  ><footer ><div Class="container-fluid"  ><div Class="row align-items-center"  ><div Class="col-md"  ><p ><a Class="btn-sm btn btn-outline-success" href="#" Target="_self"  >I ♥ PS ></a></p></div><div Class="col-md"  ><p ><a href="https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/Pode" Target="_blank"  >pode</a> and <a href="https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/PSHTML" Target="_blank"  >PSHTML</a></p></div><div Class="col-md" Style="color:#000"  ><p >Created at 2024-08-18 14:53:00</p></div></div></div></footer></div></html>
